(3782922, 535244, 73998, '<td valign="top">Good idea!  Going from civilian to soldier is definitely a big transition.  However, I do find the background somewhat distracting.  I think this would look much better with just a plain white or black background.</td>', 'Good idea!  Going from civilian to soldier is definitely a big transition.  However, I do find the background somewhat distracting.  I think this would look much better with just a plain white or black background.', '2007-06-14 10:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
