(3783174, 530701, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like how the father is standing up on the doorway and the son is down on the sidewalk.  Great tones here.  I love it.  It creates a story in the viewer''s mind even if we don''t know what the "true" one is.  Great mixture of textures and tones.</td>', 'I like how the father is standing up on the doorway and the son is down on the sidewalk.  Great tones here.  I love it.  It creates a story in the viewer''s mind even if we don''t know what the "true" one is.  Great mixture of textures and tones.', '2007-06-14 11:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
