(3784235, 532786, 39679, '<td valign="top">It''s far too common that photographers use black and white with no thought as to if it really does anything for the shot.  This is an excellent example of when to use black and white.  The flower''s texture is nicely accentuated.  The density is perfect and the subject is nicely balanced with the black space on the left.  Great shot.</td>', 'It''s far too common that photographers use black and white with no thought as to if it really does anything for the shot.  This is an excellent example of when to use black and white.  The flower''s texture is nicely accentuated.  The density is perfect and the subject is nicely balanced with the black space on the left.  Great shot.', '2007-06-14 15:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
