(3784567, 533683, 28882, '<td valign="top">not seeing the transition here unless it''s the assumed change from daughter to mother.  the title might be confusing me.  nice candid, good expressions.<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>you don''t have to take my comments so personally, they are based on my perception of the photo and not the photographer.  i agree that the title shouldn''t have to be relied upon to aid the viewer in understanding the image, but when there IS a title it DOES have an effect on the perception of the message.  Here it confused ME as to the transition aspect of the shot.  <br/>Also you ought to wait until the voting is over to PM someone regarding this type of thing.  How do you know you won''t get a negitive reaction and cause voter to go back and drop the score he gave.</td>', 'not seeing the transition here unless it''s the assumed change from daughter to mother.  the title might be confusing me.  nice candid, good expressions.   you don''t have to take my comments so personally, they are based on my perception of the photo and not the photographer.  i agree that the title shouldn''t have to be relied upon to aid the viewer in understanding the image, but when there IS a title it DOES have an effect on the perception of the message.  Here it confused ME as to the transition aspect of the shot.  Also you ought to wait until the voting is over to PM someone regarding this type of thing.  How do you know you won''t get a negitive reaction and cause voter to go back and drop the score he gave.', '2007-06-14 16:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
