(3787435, 535435, 39430, '<td valign="top">Maybe you could push the saturation a little more.  :)  I''m kidding.  The white bg is a little harsh though.</td>', 'Maybe you could push the saturation a little more.  :)  I''m kidding.  The white bg is a little harsh though.', '2007-06-15 08:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
