(3787556, 531670, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice one!  I like the shades of brown throughout the image.  I might have chosen to use a slightly close crop, or maybe a different camera angle to add a little more interest.</td>', 'Nice one!  I like the shades of brown throughout the image.  I might have chosen to use a slightly close crop, or maybe a different camera angle to add a little more interest.', '2007-06-15 08:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
