(3788369, 529595, 78303, '<td valign="top">What would be even better is if you could catch this at the moment his clothes are still half dry and wet, showing the transition.  But, I like this one also.</td>', 'What would be even better is if you could catch this at the moment his clothes are still half dry and wet, showing the transition.  But, I like this one also.', '2007-06-15 14:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
