(3793066, 533314, 28742, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the background - stark white would''ve been the ticket for me. Otherwise a very good and crisp image.</td>', 'Not a fan of the background - stark white would''ve been the ticket for me. Otherwise a very good and crisp image.', '2007-06-17 05:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
