(3793880, 534780, 67258, '<td valign="top">A nice portrait, but there is something unnatural looking about the textures - the skin and hair over the face look too smooth, almost as though the are painted.</td>', 'A nice portrait, but there is something unnatural looking about the textures - the skin and hair over the face look too smooth, almost as though the are painted.', '2007-06-17 14:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3793889, 530701, 67258, '<td valign="top">Shambles is the old English word for butchers.  Here in York we have a very old street called The Shambles, after the many butchers shops that were located there; sadly the last one closed a couple of years ago to make way for yet another shop selling tourist tat.  I like this photo - it sums up all that is good about independent family shops.  Very well done.</td>', 'Shambles is the old English word for butchers.  Here in York we have a very old street called The Shambles, after the many butchers shops that were located there; sadly the last one closed a couple of years ago to make way for yet another shop selling tourist tat.  I like this photo - it sums up all that is good about independent family shops.  Very well done.', '2007-06-17 14:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3793910, 534772, 67258, '<td valign="top">Hmm, if I push my monitor right back I can see the detail in the adult swans, but if I leave it so that I can see the full range in the white-greyscale-black  rectangle, it appears very over exposed.  Nonetheless, beautifully observed.</td>', 'Hmm, if I push my monitor right back I can see the detail in the adult swans, but if I leave it so that I can see the full range in the white-greyscale-black  rectangle, it appears very over exposed.  Nonetheless, beautifully observed.', '2007-06-17 14:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3794047, 533901, 61863, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp clean photo with great colours</td>', 'Nice crisp clean photo with great colours', '2007-06-17 16:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3794048, 533926, 61863, '<td valign="top">Good colours, focus &amp; sentiment - like it</td>', 'Good colours, focus & sentiment - like it', '2007-06-17 16:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
