(3794616, 534891, 57060, '<td valign="top">really nice shot, too bad about the chairs or whatever they are in the center and the cabana roof on the L. a bit lower pov and then even cropping to just the center may have made this an outstanding shot, as it is it is still good, but you were very close to a really great shot<br/>7 Jack</td>', 'really nice shot, too bad about the chairs or whatever they are in the center and the cabana roof on the L. a bit lower pov and then even cropping to just the center may have made this an outstanding shot, as it is it is still good, but you were very close to a really great shot7 Jack', '2007-06-17 19:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
