(3800821, 534986, 65468, '<td valign="top">A different crop would have been better for me.  If the transition is land to water the blow out of lights in the hotel or building area is annoying and not needed to meet the challenge.</td>', 'A different crop would have been better for me.  If the transition is land to water the blow out of lights in the hotel or building area is annoying and not needed to meet the challenge.', '2007-06-19 08:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
