(3800847, 533914, 65468, '<td valign="top">Good comp, rule of 1/3''s and for me the soft focus blends to the transition of waking up.  Hope it doesn''t detract from the ratings.</td>', 'Good comp, rule of 1/3''s and for me the soft focus blends to the transition of waking up.  Hope it doesn''t detract from the ratings.', '2007-06-19 08:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
