(3800887, 534896, 79832, '<td valign="top">Good composition and tones. For some reason there appears to some effect that is either making it too grainy or over sharpened or some similar effect that is distracting for my tastes.</td>', 'Good composition and tones. For some reason there appears to some effect that is either making it too grainy or over sharpened or some similar effect that is distracting for my tastes.', '2007-06-19 09:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
