(3800901, 533522, 79832, '<td valign="top">Nice composition with the 3 yellow flowers. In direct sunlight the harshness of light means a loss of fine detail and light tones in flower leaves. Having a fondness for abstract my I really likes the one closed bud just about to open. I think that could make a great subject with richer tones and colours.  The blueish background works to contrast the yellows.</td>', 'Nice composition with the 3 yellow flowers. In direct sunlight the harshness of light means a loss of fine detail and light tones in flower leaves. Having a fondness for abstract my I really likes the one closed bud just about to open. I think that could make a great subject with richer tones and colours.  The blueish background works to contrast the yellows.', '2007-06-19 09:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3800903, 535546, 79832, '<td valign="top">There is some interesting detail and tones in this sugject, unfortunately the focus is too soft.</td>', 'There is some interesting detail and tones in this sugject, unfortunately the focus is too soft.', '2007-06-19 09:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3800907, 534913, 79832, '<td valign="top">Having the small red rose in the center of image makes it too static. For such a vivid item it is better if it is in one of the power points and a little larger</td>', 'Having the small red rose in the center of image makes it too static. For such a vivid item it is better if it is in one of the power points and a little larger', '2007-06-19 09:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3800913, 534940, 72318, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and transition but the background is way to distracting with all those oof highlights that it takes away from the subject.  I hear (because i''m no flower photographer) that some carry a large peice of black or white card around when out and put it behind the flowers when taking a shot - i think this would have benefitted a lot from that technique.</td>', 'Nice idea and transition but the background is way to distracting with all those oof highlights that it takes away from the subject.  I hear (because i''m no flower photographer) that some carry a large peice of black or white card around when out and put it behind the flowers when taking a shot - i think this would have benefitted a lot from that technique.', '2007-06-19 09:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3800914, 534955, 79832, '<td valign="top">For me there is something amusing and interesting about this scene. The hands above almost form 2 eyes and the brad a nose which plays on the subject below and yes my imagination is a bit bend at times. I enjoyed this shot</td>', 'For me there is something amusing and interesting about this scene. The hands above almost form 2 eyes and the brad a nose which plays on the subject below and yes my imagination is a bit bend at times. I enjoyed this shot', '2007-06-19 09:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
