(3803390, 534915, 50695, '<td valign="top">um... is that a vibrator? oh, it''s an earphone! this intrigues me, that you can go through this entire transition without physically interacting with the other person. quite a cultural statement you''re making! plus it''s grainy, so I''ll give you a 6.</td>', 'um... is that a vibrator? oh, it''s an earphone! this intrigues me, that you can go through this entire transition without physically interacting with the other person. quite a cultural statement you''re making! plus it''s grainy, so I''ll give you a 6.', '2007-06-19 20:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
