(3810633, 531911, 66952, '<td valign="top">It''s a lovely shot, and if I''d voted in this challenge, I would have probably given it a 7. If the guy''s face were clearer, it would have been an 8 or 9. As to why it didn''t score better overall...the one time I entered a foggy photo, I got the comment, <i>"where are the white and black colors in this capture... So few colors on the scale of 256.."</i> DPC rewards images that are more simple and obvious than this one is.</td>', 'It''s a lovely shot, and if I''d voted in this challenge, I would have probably given it a 7. If the guy''s face were clearer, it would have been an 8 or 9. As to why it didn''t score better overall...the one time I entered a foggy photo, I got the comment, "where are the white and black colors in this capture... So few colors on the scale of 256.." DPC rewards images that are more simple and obvious than this one is.', '2007-06-20 19:35:15.000000', NULL, 0),
