(3812298, 534910, 67697, '<td valign="top">I think as soon as people see a flash in a photo, they yell snapshot.  This might have been better received in Candid since it is obviously not posed.  I like that he is looking right at you and you really did a nice job of capturing a moment of pure joy.  Fun photo and a great idea for a transition!</td>', 'I think as soon as people see a flash in a photo, they yell snapshot.  This might have been better received in Candid since it is obviously not posed.  I like that he is looking right at you and you really did a nice job of capturing a moment of pure joy.  Fun photo and a great idea for a transition!', '2007-06-21 00:48:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3812423, 534781, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think those yellow rascals are the hardest to shoot. They almost never seem to stay in one place long enough to focus. I like the way this butterfly is clinging to the net. It really looks like it''s not very easy for him.</td>', 'I think those yellow rascals are the hardest to shoot. They almost never seem to stay in one place long enough to focus. I like the way this butterfly is clinging to the net. It really looks like it''s not very easy for him.', '2007-06-21 01:09:03.000000', NULL, 0),
