(3812685, 531892, 22734, '<td valign="top">I am on vacation but this image awakens by gone memories. As a child I was shown how to make these shapes. All that aside, I must give praise to Jorge for this acute magical stroke of genius. He is a super rising star with such velocity in ideas and their presentation. The concept here is sheer beauty of form and delightful concept. Jorge: you are rising by leaps and bounds and your ideas are so fresh and unique and there is so much more to come!<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your spectacular recent efforts and with the snatch of the Blue on this gem of a study.</td>', 'I am on vacation but this image awakens by gone memories. As a child I was shown how to make these shapes. All that aside, I must give praise to Jorge for this acute magical stroke of genius. He is a super rising star with such velocity in ideas and their presentation. The concept here is sheer beauty of form and delightful concept. Jorge: you are rising by leaps and bounds and your ideas are so fresh and unique and there is so much more to come! Congratulations on your spectacular recent efforts and with the snatch of the Blue on this gem of a study.', '2007-06-21 01:40:13.000000', NULL, 0),
