(3831549, 533632, 74605, '<td valign="top">This is great! The composition is really nice!  I like the way the background enhances the hand holding the weeds.  The sharpeness of the hand and weeds are great!</td>', 'This is great! The composition is really nice!  I like the way the background enhances the hand holding the weeds.  The sharpeness of the hand and weeds are great!', '2007-06-25 11:14:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3831640, 535038, 28710, '<td valign="top">Gritty and (I don''t usually say this) a little shitty. <br/> <br/>In other words it''s powerful in a negative way. Do I hate it? no. Do I love it? I really don''t think it''s about the Black and White of it...<br/> <br/>only thing i would do differently is to see if I could overpower the noise with some luminance noise rather than chrominance noise. Would shift the focus a bit from the technical to the content.<br/> <br/>I wonder if anyone else noticed the big jug of orange tang sitting off to his left... The accompaniment of methadone where I come from.<br/> <br/>I doubt that this pic would have the same impact without the title.</td>', 'Gritty and (I don''t usually say this) a little shitty.  In other words it''s powerful in a negative way. Do I hate it? no. Do I love it? I really don''t think it''s about the Black and White of it... only thing i would do differently is to see if I could overpower the noise with some luminance noise rather than chrominance noise. Would shift the focus a bit from the technical to the content. I wonder if anyone else noticed the big jug of orange tang sitting off to his left... The accompaniment of methadone where I come from. I doubt that this pic would have the same impact without the title.', '2007-06-25 11:40:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3831685, 534784, 67697, '<td valign="top">I remember this during the challenge.  I was glad that you were trying to show the face... because I saw one there and was hoping that I was NOT the only one who did actually SEE it lol.</td>', 'I remember this during the challenge.  I was glad that you were trying to show the face... because I saw one there and was hoping that I was NOT the only one who did actually SEE it lol.', '2007-06-25 12:05:04.000000', NULL, 0),
