(3833077, 534784, 64994, '<td valign="top">Creepy! I like that in a pic, lol. I think the harshness gives it an almost B-grade movie poster feel.</td>', 'Creepy! I like that in a pic, lol. I think the harshness gives it an almost B-grade movie poster feel.', '2007-06-25 18:53:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3833179, 533942, 76198, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the critique club! <br/> <br/><b>Pros:</b> <br/> <br/>You have an unusual and creative composition; I love to see experiments! I think the interesting take helped keep peoples interest up, and got them to overlook some technical issues.<br/> <br/><b>Cons:</b> <br/> <br/>As I suggested above, there are technical problems with the shot; it''s a bit noisy and blurry. The feathers are likely blurred from a little bit of movement between the different shots? Your hand is quite out of focus on the left side of the shot. <br/> <br/><b>The Challenge:</b> <br/> <br/>This is one of those challenges with a lot of room for interpretation; I can''t claim I really get what you were going for here, but the sense of movement from right to left, and the changing number of fingers, does imply some transition. <br/> <br/>Thanks!<br/> <br/>-Evan</td>', 'Greetings from the critique club!  Pros:  You have an unusual and creative composition; I love to see experiments! I think the interesting take helped keep peoples interest up, and got them to overlook some technical issues. Cons:  As I suggested above, there are technical problems with the shot; it''s a bit noisy and blurry. The feathers are likely blurred from a little bit of movement between the different shots? Your hand is quite out of focus on the left side of the shot.  The Challenge:  This is one of those challenges with a lot of room for interpretation; I can''t claim I really get what you were going for here, but the sense of movement from right to left, and the changing number of fingers, does imply some transition.  Thanks! -Evan', '2007-06-25 19:18:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3833594, 531892, 42013, '<td valign="top">You might give Scalvert a run for his money! Congrats Jorge. I always enjoy seeing what comes from your mind next.</td>', 'You might give Scalvert a run for his money! Congrats Jorge. I always enjoy seeing what comes from your mind next.', '2007-06-25 20:54:03.000000', NULL, 0),
