(3833778, 534590, 1024, '<td valign="top">I have read the previous comments about the cropping, and I have to disagree with the majority.  By cropping it this way you have focused the eye exactly where you want it to be.  Wonderful use of negative space as well.  Beautiful shot, you should be very proud of this one!</td>', 'I have read the previous comments about the cropping, and I have to disagree with the majority.  By cropping it this way you have focused the eye exactly where you want it to be.  Wonderful use of negative space as well.  Beautiful shot, you should be very proud of this one!', '2007-06-25 21:36:58.000000', NULL, 0),
