(3838258, 531911, 45475, '<td valign="top">I quite like the blue tint on this. Also think you did an outstanding job in foggy conditions. Yep, very appealing and atmospheric.</td>', 'I quite like the blue tint on this. Also think you did an outstanding job in foggy conditions. Yep, very appealing and atmospheric.', '2007-06-26 20:55:28.000000', NULL, 0),
