(3840329, 535159, 78396, '<td valign="top">This is smoke, produced by a vanilla incense stick :-)<br/> <br/>Too bad that I didn''t had my pc when I had to resize the picture, so the image quality is very bad (I had to use MS Paint!).</td>', 'This is smoke, produced by a vanilla incense stick :-) Too bad that I didn''t had my pc when I had to resize the picture, so the image quality is very bad (I had to use MS Paint!).', '2007-06-27 04:51:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3843117, 532631, 29011, '<td valign="top">Really like the mystery to this b/w version. I slighty prefer the color version. A wonderful find with the iceberg in the shot and nicely captured. Have you thought of combing the two exposures, the one with the iceberg and the outtake, so the lighthouse would be more clearly seen for an interesting juxtaposition?</td>', 'Really like the mystery to this b/w version. I slighty prefer the color version. A wonderful find with the iceberg in the shot and nicely captured. Have you thought of combing the two exposures, the one with the iceberg and the outtake, so the lighthouse would be more clearly seen for an interesting juxtaposition?', '2007-06-27 20:05:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3844298, 533487, 34113, '<td valign="top">Great colors and the swirl of the rock makes it look like a lost wheel on its edge, just coming to rest in the desert.</td>', 'Great colors and the swirl of the rock makes it look like a lost wheel on its edge, just coming to rest in the desert.', '2007-06-28 02:00:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3844926, 533487, 74605, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! The colors in the sand stone stand out nicely against the wonderfully blue sky!</td>', 'Beautiful! The colors in the sand stone stand out nicely against the wonderfully blue sky!', '2007-06-28 10:42:11.000000', NULL, 0),
