(4868966, 534096, 68624, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by HeiSch:</b></div><hr/><i> this looks more like a snapshot to me than a composed picture. 2 of the 3 faces are partially covered. the bright lights and the 4th guy are distracting. Your exposure on the other side is good. only small parts of the white t-shirt are blwon out. tones of the skin and cloths remain natural. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>delayed response but.... yes, it''s a snapshot. taking the time to compose a photo is easy, studio shots are a dime a dozen. get three random guys on an Manhattan street corner to pose for a random photo and you''ve captured something real.</td>', 'Originally posted by HeiSch: this looks more like a snapshot to me than a composed picture. 2 of the 3 faces are partially covered. the bright lights and the 4th guy are distracting. Your exposure on the other side is good. only small parts of the white t-shirt are blwon out. tones of the skin and cloths remain natural.   delayed response but.... yes, it''s a snapshot. taking the time to compose a photo is easy, studio shots are a dime a dozen. get three random guys on an Manhattan street corner to pose for a random photo and you''ve captured something real.', '2008-08-06 04:35:27.000000', NULL, 0),
